    "detailed_description": "A short but eventful visual novel that will immerse you in the indescribable atmosphere of Russian reality.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAn ordinary russian school leaver Alexander gets summer side job as storekeeper in subway's lost and found. His dream is to earn money before university to buy a gaming laptop exclusively for study purposes. But is this job as easy as he imagines it? <br />\r\nYou'll see: <br />\r\n- Ruthless and indifferent bureaucratic machine and protagonist's fight against it. <br />\r\n- A detective investigation into the return of a lost notebook to a mysterious stranger. <br />\r\n- A peek to the dark and death-breathing side of the subway in a noir adventure.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n- Branched plot where each choice affects the ending<br />\r\n- Character design by the artist of &quot;Everlasting Summer&quot;<br />\r\n- Voice acting of the main characters in Russian and original soundtrack",
